---
import Icon from './Icon.astro'
---

<section id="about" class="px-6 sm:px-8 py-20">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">

    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 reveal">
      <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
      <p class="text-muted-2 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide">About Me</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[65%_35%] gap-10 items-start">
      <!-- Text -->
      <div class="reveal">
        <h2 class="font-sans font-bold text-[clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.25rem)] leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink mb-6">
          A developer who builds things that <em class="text-accent italic">think, look good, and ship.</em>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-muted text-[15px] leading-relaxed mb-5">
          I'm a final year BCA student at Thames International College, Kathmandu,
          focused on building intelligent web products. I work across the full
          stack, from training ML models to deploying polished interfaces, with a
          particular interest in making AI actually useful to real people.
        </p>
        <p class="text-muted text-[15px] leading-relaxed mb-10">
          When I'm not building, I'm obsessing over UI details, exploring new ML
          techniques, or figuring out how to make something faster and cleaner
          than it was yesterday.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a
            href="/files/Chris_Bhaila_Resume.pdf"
            target="_blank"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-ink text-white text-sm font-medium rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 hover:bg-ink/85 transition-colors duration-200"
          >
            <Icon name="download" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
            Download CV
          </a>

          <a
            href="#contact"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-border text-ink text-sm font-medium rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 hover:border-ink/30 transition-colors duration-200"
          >
            Open to work
            <span class="relative flex h-1.5 w-1.5">
              <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-good opacity-75"></span>
              <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-1.5 w-1.5 bg-good"></span>
            </span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Photo -->
      <div class="reveal flex justify-center md:justify-end order-first md:order-last">
        <div class="w-48 h-48 sm:w-64 sm:h-64 rounded-full overflow-hidden border-4 border-surface shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--color-border)]">
          <img
            src="/images/chris.jpg"
            alt="Chris Bhaila"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
